## INPUT CONTRACT — CSV SCHEMA (7 columns)

*(Unchanged from v5.0 — not touched this cycle)*

| Column | Name | Required | Notes |
|--------|------|----------|-------|
| 1 | Date | YES | Review publication date |
| 2 | Platform | YES | Google / Yelp / OpenTable / TripAdvisor / Manual |
| 3 | Stars rating | YES | Integer 1–5. Column name is `Stars rating` — exact match required |
| 4 | Raw Text | YES | Full guest review text. Blank permitted (star-only reviews) |
| 5 | Reviewer Name | NO | Guest name or handle. Null permitted |
