**Step 7 - Star Rating Extraction** *(Chat #88 update)*
Preserves `star_rating` from Step 4 upstream. Previously recalculated from inline `[4★]` text notation — overwriting the CSV value with null. Now reads `row.star_rating` directly.

```javascript
const row = $input.first().json;
const rawText = row.raw_text || '';
const starMatch = rawText.match(/^\[(\d)[★*]?\]/);
let cleanText = rawText;
if (starMatch) {
  cleanText = rawText.replace(/^\[\d[★*]?\]\s*/, '').trim();
}
return [{ json: { ...row, star_rating: row.star_rating, clean_text: cleanText, raw_text_original: rawText } }];
```

Inline text cleaning still runs if `[4★]` notation is present — backward compatible.

